<p>Yeah, I'm gonna echo Quadradiginta's point here. I can see tons of different LSD connections that could work in a really interesting anomaly - connections to the CIA <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Project_MKUltra">MK-Ultra</a> project, maybe an anomalous LSD type thing that has the monster slowly drain your identity for it to be 'filled' with another identity - or something of the like. We could see diary entries from either people involved in the project or people infected by the drug, see how it effects them, and etc&#8230;</p>
