<p>Hmm&#8230; the story sounds interesting enough. With an MK ultra storyline, I'd try and convey how much abuse was actually faced by the test subject - which, don't get me wrong, your idea is already doing. But - at least in my opinion, it would be more interesting if the anomalous effects where a feature rather than a bug. If your gonna do a reality-warping thing, maybe the tablets cause reality to appear to warp in a way that makes people with the tablets to act in the interests of the project (e.g being unable to perceive or comprehend that the American government could do anything wrong). Perhaps the only reason why this failed was the creature appearing in every batch they made, and they can't explain it. But that's just spitballing.</p>
